                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A technique for viewing the bronchi using a flexible instrument called a bronchoscope."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81f0de81-5d57-4877-a331-2f95e42ce1a9",
                                                "sense_id": "5d669b47-93a6-3dc5-a8b8-9eb43d594d4a",
                                                "text": "The center reported in May that its tests showed that Mr. Speaker had XDR-TB, based on cultures from a lung procedure, a bronchoscopy, at a hospital in Atlanta."
                                            }
